# Environment variables — SIH26168

No secrets are required to run or deploy this project:

- Map tiles: keyless CARTO basemaps (hardcoded public style URL in `src/components/map/NavMap.tsx`)
- Backend: runs on localhost by default; frontend works fully without it
- No database, no auth, no JWT, no model registry credentials

Optional overrides (copy to `.env` only if you need them):

```ini
# Port for local backend (default 8000)
PORT=8000

# Base URL scripts/tools use to reach the API (default http://localhost:8000)
BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8000
```

The frontend reads the backend URL from the Settings page (UI state), not from
build-time environment variables, so no `VITE_*` keys are needed.
